    {
      "text": "### Sources API methods",
      "sourceIndex": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "If your code uses methods like createSource and retrieveSource from the legacy Sources API, migrate your integration to use the Payment Methods API instead.",
      "sourceIndex": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "The Payment Methods API provides better support for payment methods, reusability, and compliance requirements.",
      "sourceIndex": 0
    }
